{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Ralsei — the prince without subjects\n\nThird hero of the Prophecy. Kind to the point of self-denial — spends much of the game not believing he deserves anything of his own.","x":-180,"y":-70,"width":380,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Physical resemblance to Asriel**\nVisual basis for the 'Ralsei is Asriel' theory.","x":-130,"y":-520,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Knows the ending of the Prophecy**\nHides the final part to protect Susie and Kris — it nearly breaks their friendship.","x":346,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Susie**\nPushes him to see himself as more than just a tool in service of the Lightners.","x":164,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Etymology of his name**\nAnagram of 'Asriel' + a reference to 'Ralse' from a game by Toby Fox's brother.","x":-424,"y":294,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Flowery**\nHis most strained relationship: old acquaintances through Asgore, now rivals.","x":-606,"y":-209,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**What is Ralsei, really?**\nFlowery calls him 'an impossibility': he appears in more than one Dark World, has no known Light World form, and knows too much about the Prophecy. No definitive textual explanation.","x":800,"y":300,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png","x":-986,"y":-133,"width":100,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel.png","x":-129,"y":-920,"width":99,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":709,"y":-357,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":418,"y":561,"width":108,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_con_gorro.gif","x":-672,"y":557,"width":109,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_face.webp","x":-860,"y":-560,"width":115,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ralsei_screenshot_overwhelmed_with_knowledge.png","x":800,"y":80,"width":200,"height":150}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"s5-img-e","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_asriel_impossible","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_flowery_impossible","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_prophecy_susie","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_etymology_asriel","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"}]}